OL,3,AUS pressures Europe to release diesel
OL,4,Areserves as Trump threatens export ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said he may ask
OL,7,FEuropean countries to release some of
OL,8,Ftheir diesel reserves as he considers
OL,9,Fbanning US exports of the fuel.
OL,11,FThe US President's comment comes after
OL,12,FTreasury Secretary Scott Bessent urged
OL,13,FEurope to get ready to release diesel
OL,14,Fsupplies immediately, arguing that US
OL,15,Ffarmers, truckers, and businesses
OL,16,F"should not be left carrying the
OL,17,Fburden" as prices soar.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
